{
  "dom_id": "step-177993",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Factoring Trinomial With Positive Coefficients",
  "problem": "Factor the quadratic expression $10a^2 + 11a + 3.$",
  "worked_solution": "We must factor the quadratic expression\n\n$$\n10a^2 + 11a + 3.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find two numbers that \n\n- multiply to the product of the quadratic coefficient and the constant ($10 \\times 3 = 30$), and\n\n- add to the linear coefficient ($11$).\n\nSince all coefficients are positive, we only need to consider the positive factor pairs of $30.$\n\nThe positive factor pairs of $30$ are\n\n$$\n(1,30), \\quad (2,15), \\quad (3,10), \\quad (5,6).\n$$\n\nNotice the numbers in the factor pair $(5,6)$ add to $11{:}$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5+6 & =11\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we write the linear term as $5a + 6a,$ and factor the result by grouping:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10{a}^{2}+11a+3 & = \\\\ 10{a}^{2}+5a+6a+3 & = \\\\ (10{a}^{2}+5a)+(6a+3) & = \\\\ 5a(2a+1)+3(2a+1) & = \\\\ (5a+3)(2a+1) & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-177993\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"177993\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"15070\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-177993\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Factoring Trinomial With Positive Coefficients</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"177993\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                