 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1001,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"748\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"2206\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3207,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"4208\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"4960\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5960,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>First, we find two numbers that </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>multiply to the product of the quadratic coefficient and the constant (<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"11.751ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 5059.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">10 \\times 3 = 30</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 